{
  "name": "pi-bridge-vs",
  "displayName": "pi-bridge-vs",
  "description": "让 VS Code 作为 Pi 的前端",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "categories": [
    "AI",
    "Other"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "ai",
    "coding agent",
    "pi",
    "liu-qingxue"
  ],
  "publisher": "liu-qingxue",
  "license": "AGPL-3.0-only",
  "author": {
    "name": "liu-qingxue",
    "email": "liu-qingxue@proton.me",
    "url": "https://github.com/liu-qingxue"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/liu-qingxue-vscode-extensions/pi-bridge-vs"
  },
  "main": "./dist/main.cjs",
  "type": "module",
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "pi-bridge.test",
        "title": "测试桥",
        "category": "pi-bridge"
      },
      {
        "command": "pi-bridge.showDebug",
        "title": "打开调试板",
        "category": "pi-bridge"
      },
      {
        "command": "pi-bridge.toggleNotices",
        "title": "展开/收起通知板",
        "category": "pi-bridge"
      },
      {
        "command": "pi-bridge.showChangelog",
        "title": "pi-bridge: 打开更新日志"
      },
      {
        "command": "pi-bridge.showInteraction",
        "title": "Pi：打开交互面板",
        "category": "Pi"
      },
      {
        "command": "pi-bridge.showSkills",
        "title": "Pi：打开技能面板",
        "category": "Pi"
      },
      {
        "command": "pi-bridge.showSessions",
        "title": "Pi：打开会话面板",
        "category": "Pi"
      },
      {
        "command": "pi-bridge.showSettings",
        "title": "Pi：打开设置面板",
        "category": "Pi"
      }
    ],
    "keybindings": [
      {
        "command": "pi-bridge.showDebug",
        "key": "ctrl+alt+d"
      },
      {
        "command": "pi-bridge.toggleNotices",
        "key": "ctrl+alt+n",
        "when": "view == pi-bridge.chatView"
      }
    ],
    "viewsContainers": {
      "activitybar": [
        {
          "id": "pi-bridge-activitybar",
          "title": "pi-bridge-vs",
          "icon": "svg/extension_face.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "pi-bridge-activitybar": [
        {
          "type": "webview",
          "id": "pi-bridge.chatView",
          "name": "Pi 会话",
          "icon": "svg/extension_face.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": [
      {
        "title": "pi-bridge：启动",
        "properties": {
          "pi-bridge.piCliPath": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "/home/liuqingxue/.npm-global/bin/pi",
            "markdownDescription": "（可选的）pi CLI 入口 `dist/cli.js` 的**绝对路径**。\n\n留空 = **自动探测**（推荐）：用 ESM 解析找到 pi 包，取其同目录的 `cli.js`。\n\n何时需要手填：扩展的 `node_modules` 里没有 pi 包、或 pi 装在非标准位置时。"
          },
          "pi-bridge.piAgentDir": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "~/.pi/agent/",
            "markdownDescription": "（可选的）pi 的**配置目录**（即 `models.json` 所在目录）。\n\n留空 = **自动探测**（推荐）：调用 pi 导出的 `getAgentDir()`，默认得到 `~/.pi/agent`（并会尊重 `PI_CONFIG_DIR` 等环境变量）。\n\n何时需要手填：你把 pi 的配置放到了非标准目录时。"
          },
          "pi-bridge.launchArgs": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "markdownDescription": "传给 pi 子进程的**额外启动参数**（默认已有 `--no-session`）。\n\n常用：\n- `--no-extensions` —— 临时禁用所有扩展。\n  场景：守卫类扩展会拦住工具执行（等待审批），而本扩展还没做 `extension_ui_request` 的响应桥时，工具会卡住。\n- `--thinking high` —— 指定思考级别\n- `--no-extensions` + `-e <path>` —— 只加载指定扩展\n\n⚠️ 修改后需**重新加载窗口**才生效（pi 子进程已启动）。"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "activationEvents": [],
  "scripts": {
    "compile": "tsc -p ./ --noEmit && npx esbuild src/main.ts --bundle --platform=node --format=cjs --external:vscode --outfile=dist/main.cjs",
    "watch": "tsc --watch -p ./",
    "vscode:prepublish": "npm run compile",
    "watch:webview": "node scripts/build-webview.mjs --watch",
    "check:webview": "tsc -p tsconfig.webview.json --noEmit"
  },
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.135.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent": "^1.1.0",
    "@truly-private/omdsh-llm-mock-server": "^0.1.0",
    "@types/edit-json-file": "^1.7.4",
    "@types/node": "^26.6.5",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.135.0",
    "commander": "^15.0.0",
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "tsx": "^4.23.15",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "bash-parser": "^0.5.0",
    "katex": "^0.18.10",
    "marked": "^18.0.14",
    "marked-footnote": "^1.4.0",
    "marked-katex-extension": "^5.1.13",
    "mermaid": "^12.1.0",
    "shiki": "^4.5.0"
  }
}
